            "text": "theorem Properties.exterior_amplitude_formula\n    (_hp : Properties h qstar Xa Xext C A D u p) (τ : ℝ) {r : ℝ} (hr : 0 < r) :\n    LocalHeatFormula.amplitude C h τ r =\n      r ^ (-1 - 2 * h) * LocalHeatFormula.exteriorProfile C h (τ / r ^ 2)"
